WEBVTT

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:09.510
The following program is intended for mature audiences
and contains Adult Content, Graphic Language,

00:00:09.590 --> 00:00:14.760
Graphic Violence, Brief Nudity and
Strong Sexual Content including rape.

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:18.390
Poison, huh?

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:22.600
I thought I'd upset my stomach
so I went to relieve myself,

00:00:22.690 --> 00:00:25.230
and when I returned, this is what I saw.

00:00:25.310 --> 00:00:27.400
How many perpetrators were there?

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:28.940
How many?

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:31.190
It was probably just two people.

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:34.320
Their names were...

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:35.870
It's okay.

00:00:35.950 --> 00:00:37.160
I already know.

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:41.580
Do you remember the name "Akagi,"

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:43.790
that I got from that attacker?

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:49.090
That first "A" was just a groan of pain.

00:00:50.130 --> 00:00:53.260
What he was trying to say before he died was...

00:00:55.220 --> 00:00:56.590
Kagimura.

00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:05.560
BLADE OF THE IMMORTAL

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:07.980
One two three

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:12.280
Undead tree

00:01:13.150 --> 00:01:14.700
What truth

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:18.370
I'll come true

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:25.540
Wow

00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:29.420
I see that bright light

00:01:31.380 --> 00:01:35.800
This is all that I have

00:01:36.510 --> 00:01:40.300
What did you say?
I know

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:44.850
Why do you say?

00:01:46.350 --> 00:01:50.520
Hone the blade, lie around

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:53.730
Survive of vision

00:01:53.820 --> 00:01:57.240
Death and pleasure are my future

00:01:57.700 --> 00:02:01.580
I got lost, I was lost

00:02:01.870 --> 00:02:05.330
Survive of vision

00:02:05.410 --> 00:02:08.620
Unfinished heaven

00:02:08.830 --> 00:02:12.380
Now fight to claim your wounds

00:02:12.710 --> 00:02:16.130
Don't know why
Don't know why

00:02:16.760 --> 00:02:20.930
Survive of vision

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:31.860
Take it.

00:02:34.730 --> 00:02:36.900
The banquet was a success.

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:39.150
The elders were ecstatic.

00:02:39.950 --> 00:02:43.450
-This is a thanks from them.
-I'm in your debt.

00:02:45.080 --> 00:02:49.580
Your son who was undergoing
medical care died this morning.

00:02:51.380 --> 00:02:52.500
What will you do?

00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:58.380
Your past merits, the acquittal of your charges,
and the cost of your son's medicine.

00:02:58.470 --> 00:03:00.130
Even with that deducted total,

00:03:00.220 --> 00:03:03.680
you'll be able to return to town
with a 70 ryo allowance.

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:07.060
Once you've decided how to use the money,

00:03:07.140 --> 00:03:09.100
come to my manor.

00:03:10.270 --> 00:03:12.860
I've already decided how I'll spend the money.

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:16.320
Please get that woman out of the Mugai-ryu.

00:03:17.150 --> 00:03:19.700
It should be possible with another 40 ryo.

00:03:20.820 --> 00:03:21.950
You speak of Hyakurin?

00:03:23.370 --> 00:03:25.160
You should give up on her.

00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:27.830
Please.

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:29.290
I cannot.

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:32.540
Giichi...

00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:38.260
To the Shogunate, a murderer's money
is but a loan waiting to be repaid.

00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:42.510
It's different than buying freedom for a prostitute,
whose function is to make money.

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:46.510
If you don't atone with your own strength,
next you will forfeit your lives.

00:03:46.600 --> 00:03:49.140
In which case, rather than let us take your heads,

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:52.480
I imagine you would find more fulfillment
dying in battle.

00:03:56.520 --> 00:03:59.110
Giichi. I have some conditions.

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:21.510
As I'm sure you are all aware,

00:04:21.590 --> 00:04:25.550
about one month ago, the lives of ten of our comrades

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:28.220
were taken in a scheme at a banquet.

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:31.730
Its perpetrator was the imperial guard,
Kagimura Habaki.

00:04:32.060 --> 00:04:34.810
This is the identity of the man
we referred to as "Akagi."

00:04:35.270 --> 00:04:39.820
It fills me with anger that so many of our comrades
have been killed in just one day,

00:04:39.900 --> 00:04:41.570
but what's truly alarming

00:04:41.940 --> 00:04:43.570
is the fact that nine of them

00:04:43.780 --> 00:04:46.660
were the ones in charge of the dojos
that dot the landscape

00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:50.490
from Musashi, Edo to Kai, Sagami.

00:04:50.830 --> 00:04:52.580
In other words,

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:57.630
the enemy is skilled,
and those nine dojos have been cut off?

00:04:58.170 --> 00:04:59.090
That's right.

00:04:59.920 --> 00:05:03.340
All of it is due to my error in judgment.

00:05:04.220 --> 00:05:08.180
I'm sorry. The truth is I may have gotten carried away.

00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:11.430
The moment I saw that things were going smoothly

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:13.770
was when I should have begun to doubt myself.

00:05:14.230 --> 00:05:17.770
Saying all of this now does us no good.

00:05:18.270 --> 00:05:22.230
The thing is,
this storm has brought together the real Itto-ryu.

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:26.990
What I'm saying is that we only need
those present here to make it through.

00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:29.370
What do you guys think?

00:05:29.870 --> 00:05:32.200
It is true that for the last two years

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:36.500
we have been a bit eager to merge dojos
and integrate sword styles.

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:39.250
Wasn't the goal to demonstrate our strength

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:41.550
and backbone to the Shogunate,

00:05:41.630 --> 00:05:44.840
not pointlessly prop up all these swordsmen?

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:46.680
It is truly unfortunate

00:05:46.760 --> 00:05:49.600
that our actions came off
as traitorous to the Shogunate,

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:52.350
rather than patriotic.

00:05:52.430 --> 00:05:54.850
But even then, this is unimaginable!

00:05:55.350 --> 00:05:57.810
I would say this is where we really dig deep.

00:05:57.900 --> 00:06:01.320
My lord, I will follow you wherever our path takes us.

00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:05.280
For our fallen comrades...

00:06:05.360 --> 00:06:07.400
I'm with our lord.

00:06:21.460 --> 00:06:23.670
Amazing! I was able to do six!

00:06:24.590 --> 00:06:25.760
Mr. Manji!

00:06:34.600 --> 00:06:35.680
Mr. Manji...

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:41.020
I met Kagehisa Anotsu on my own.

00:06:43.270 --> 00:06:44.860
Just for a moment...

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:01.130
There will be no running away,

00:07:01.920 --> 00:07:02.960
Makoto.

00:07:04.130 --> 00:07:06.420
I left you to your own devices too long.

00:07:07.880 --> 00:07:10.380
Dog of the Shogunate, huh?

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:29.150
Pitiful.

00:07:33.950 --> 00:07:35.280
Rin, was it?

00:07:35.620 --> 00:07:36.790
Yes.

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:39.040
How old are you?

00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:41.620
I'm 16.

00:07:42.670 --> 00:07:45.750
That's plenty old to be living on your own, I'm sure.

00:07:50.340 --> 00:07:51.880
What do you want?

00:07:53.930 --> 00:07:57.140
What I'm about to ask you
comes straight from the mouth

00:07:57.220 --> 00:08:00.180
of the Mugai-ryu's leader
and imperial guard, Kagimura Habaki.

00:08:01.190 --> 00:08:03.400
Take this as an imperial command, as it were.

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:07.190
You will be joining the Mugai-ryu on this very day.

00:08:09.110 --> 00:08:10.240
There it is.

00:08:10.650 --> 00:08:12.150
The charges you bear

00:08:12.530 --> 00:08:15.410
far outstrip what any of us in the Mugai-ryu have done.

00:08:16.030 --> 00:08:17.950
You've just been overlooked.

00:08:18.410 --> 00:08:21.290
That is to say, due the value of your
involvement with the Itto-ryu,

00:08:21.370 --> 00:08:23.710
the Shogunate has turned the other cheek.

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:25.540
But now the time is ripe.

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:30.210
We must advance our piece to the next stage.

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:32.550
To that end, we need manpower.

00:08:33.550 --> 00:08:37.050
What we need is strength that can hold up to theirs.

00:08:37.510 --> 00:08:38.850
That's why it's me?

00:08:38.930 --> 00:08:41.060
What an honoring offer.

00:08:41.140 --> 00:08:43.350
There's no honor to be had here.

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:45.190
If the Itto-ryu is toxic,

00:08:45.270 --> 00:08:47.310
then both you and I are toxic as well.

00:08:47.900 --> 00:08:49.150
It's a case where

00:08:49.230 --> 00:08:52.360
rather than just kill them,
ideally, we should all kill each other.

00:08:52.440 --> 00:08:53.860
At least in their eyes.

00:08:55.110 --> 00:08:56.740
And if I say no?

00:08:59.790 --> 00:09:00.910
If you refuse...

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:05.170
the man before you now

00:09:05.250 --> 00:09:06.750
will kill you.

00:09:10.550 --> 00:09:11.760
Mr. Manji?

00:09:16.470 --> 00:09:20.010
That's the first implement I've seen in a long time
that I just have to have.

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:22.520
Sorry, but once I get that feeling,

00:09:22.600 --> 00:09:25.100
it'll end up in here in about half an hour.

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:30.400
If you stab through my neck or heart, I'm dead.

00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:33.030
How about you?

00:09:34.190 --> 00:09:37.700
Are you daft? Why would I tell you my own weak points?

00:09:37.780 --> 00:09:39.660
I'm asking for your sake.

00:09:40.870 --> 00:09:43.000
I can't lose for you,

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:46.330
but I can make the suffering shorter.

00:09:47.790 --> 00:09:51.000
Well, gosh, I appreciate all the care
you're taking for me.

00:09:52.050 --> 00:09:54.170
It's fine, don't hold back.

00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:58.430
Cut me up however you like, if you can that is!

00:10:41.090 --> 00:10:44.470
I've not once suffered an enemy to survive
after reaching this position.

00:10:44.720 --> 00:10:45.810
Manji,

00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:48.270
wasting your life is the same as discarding it.

00:10:48.350 --> 00:10:53.360
If you'd throw it away in a place like this,
then entrust that life to the Mugai-ryu.

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:56.610
Come with me. If you do, I'll release you.

00:10:56.990 --> 00:11:01.700
You say that, but do you really want the life
of a man who would easily say yes to that?

00:11:02.780 --> 00:11:03.870
So be it.

00:11:04.370 --> 00:11:05.200
Die.

00:11:16.670 --> 00:11:19.670
You think this is a joke?

00:11:38.190 --> 00:11:40.950
You finally let go.

00:11:41.030 --> 00:11:42.950
Whether I let go or not,

00:11:43.030 --> 00:11:45.950
it's made so you can't remove it
without knowing the trick.

00:11:47.240 --> 00:11:48.370
Is that so?

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:50.290
Then I've got no choice.

00:11:50.830 --> 00:11:54.670
I try to avoid doing barbaric stuff like this, but...

00:12:22.900 --> 00:12:25.160
This is useless now.

00:12:25.700 --> 00:12:27.580
Sorry about that.

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:31.790
I'll lend you the ones laying over there if you want.

00:12:31.870 --> 00:12:34.290
I'm sure you'd be able to use them somehow.

00:12:34.880 --> 00:12:38.960
Let's keep at it. We're both still in one piece.

00:12:40.460 --> 00:12:41.300
No.

00:12:43.090 --> 00:12:44.630
Let us go again another day.

00:12:45.640 --> 00:12:47.760
I'm drained for the day.

00:12:47.850 --> 00:12:50.720
Then should we call this one a win for me?

00:12:51.730 --> 00:12:53.060
I suppose we should.

00:12:55.560 --> 00:12:56.610
Giichi...

00:12:57.810 --> 00:12:58.940
Very well.

00:12:59.320 --> 00:13:02.650
Bring me to this Shogun's servant of the Mugai-ryu.

00:13:03.650 --> 00:13:07.120
Don't misunderstand,
I'm not becoming an ally of yours.

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:13.040
I'm interested now in the face
of the man who's higher up than you.

00:13:13.710 --> 00:13:15.210
You never cease to amaze me.

00:13:25.720 --> 00:13:27.180
Thank goodness.

00:13:32.140 --> 00:13:34.310
Are you sure about this?

00:13:34.850 --> 00:13:35.890
Yes.

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:47.990
We will hereby erase our tracks,

00:13:48.070 --> 00:13:49.780
and go into hiding underground.

00:13:50.240 --> 00:13:51.830
In the winter we rise.

00:13:52.370 --> 00:13:53.950
Until then, everyone,

00:13:54.370 --> 00:13:55.870
stay safe.

00:13:59.210 --> 00:14:02.590
Mugai-ryu... Itto-ryu...

00:14:02.670 --> 00:14:05.550
And the man I will meet shortly.

00:14:06.090 --> 00:14:10.390
What could they all be fighting against?

00:14:12.180 --> 00:14:14.020
Pitiable.

00:14:14.100 --> 00:14:18.020
They are so pitiable, it even makes me envious.

00:14:39.580 --> 00:14:41.080
You sure are dumb.

00:14:41.170 --> 00:14:43.170
You could have waited in the tatami room.

00:14:43.630 --> 00:14:45.340
Miss Hyakurin.

00:14:46.880 --> 00:14:51.340
Mr. Manji said he didn't know how things
would turn out, so I shouldn't come in.

00:14:52.010 --> 00:14:54.220
He won't bite!

00:14:56.310 --> 00:14:58.310
It's really pouring.

00:14:59.560 --> 00:15:00.940
Want to go eat something sweet?

00:15:01.690 --> 00:15:02.860
Yes!

00:15:04.230 --> 00:15:06.400
Rin, your face has gotten pretty tough

00:15:06.480 --> 00:15:09.530
since around the time of the bathhouse.

00:15:09.610 --> 00:15:12.870
Is that so? Well I did lose weight.

00:15:12.950 --> 00:15:16.830
Oh, I see. You're thinner. Yeah, that must be it.

00:15:17.330 --> 00:15:18.460
What happened to your arm?

00:15:19.460 --> 00:15:20.460
A sprain.

00:15:23.630 --> 00:15:25.840
You're not with that person today?

00:15:25.920 --> 00:15:28.550
That... That young guy.

00:15:29.220 --> 00:15:30.180
Shinriji?

00:15:33.090 --> 00:15:34.680
He's no longer here.

00:15:35.310 --> 00:15:36.970
He went back to his mother's.

00:15:37.060 --> 00:15:39.270
Oh, well isn't that nice?

00:15:39.890 --> 00:15:41.190
It sure is.

00:15:45.770 --> 00:15:49.900
Are you that scared of being seen
speaking with a criminal?

00:15:50.530 --> 00:15:51.700
And what is this?

00:15:51.780 --> 00:15:55.580
You summon people and don't offer them any tea
here at this manor?

00:15:55.660 --> 00:15:57.790
Do not overstep, young one.

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:01.250
Of those 100 men you killed,

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:05.750
nine of them were subordinates of mine.

00:16:07.670 --> 00:16:09.260
My apologies.

00:16:09.670 --> 00:16:12.550
So did you call me here to tell me that?

00:16:12.880 --> 00:16:14.260
Not quite.

00:16:14.550 --> 00:16:16.050
I called you here

00:16:16.140 --> 00:16:18.810
because there are two or three things I must confirm.

00:16:19.890 --> 00:16:21.270
I have heard that you

00:16:22.270 --> 00:16:24.690
are immortal. Is it true?

00:16:27.940 --> 00:16:29.610
Were you born that way?

00:16:30.690 --> 00:16:32.990
No such human exists.

00:16:33.070 --> 00:16:37.330
Then, do you remember when you became immortal?

00:16:37.620 --> 00:16:39.450
I can't quite recall it.

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:43.250
I've got this feeling that some weird old lady
messed with my body.

00:16:43.580 --> 00:16:45.380
Where is that woman?

00:16:45.920 --> 00:16:47.000
Who knows?

00:16:48.670 --> 00:16:50.300
I will change the question.

00:16:51.300 --> 00:16:54.220
You... Let's see...

00:16:54.300 --> 00:16:56.680
What would happen if you were stabbed here?

00:16:57.140 --> 00:16:59.680
I've been stabbed there countless times.

00:17:00.810 --> 00:17:05.100
If that's true, your immortality
must be rather absolute, no?

00:17:05.190 --> 00:17:09.070
No, unfortunately, it's not such a fairy tale.

00:17:09.150 --> 00:17:12.240
There are ways to kill me and for me to die.

00:17:12.320 --> 00:17:13.950
Plenty of them.

00:17:14.030 --> 00:17:15.570
Could you give an example?

00:17:15.660 --> 00:17:17.410
Do you really think I would?

00:17:18.410 --> 00:17:22.410
If you want, you're free to give it a try by force.

00:17:23.960 --> 00:17:28.000
You're strong aren't you?
You must be to order that baldy around.

00:17:28.630 --> 00:17:31.250
I'm not sure what your intentions are,

00:17:31.630 --> 00:17:33.630
but from the moment I walked onto this estate,

00:17:33.720 --> 00:17:36.220
I've had approximately that intention.

00:17:36.300 --> 00:17:38.430
Well, general?

00:17:38.510 --> 00:17:41.680
How long are we going to beat around the--?

00:17:50.270 --> 00:17:52.230
-You...!
-Wait, wait, wait!

00:17:52.320 --> 00:17:53.320
Screw you!

00:17:53.400 --> 00:17:54.650
Listen, Manji.

00:17:54.740 --> 00:17:57.610
I have no intention of fighting you here.

00:17:57.700 --> 00:17:59.120
It's the truth.

00:17:59.200 --> 00:18:02.200
I will not move from here
until the hole in your chest closes!

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:09.420
You little...

00:18:27.060 --> 00:18:28.230
Incredible.

00:18:28.650 --> 00:18:31.150
Let me tell you, old man!

00:18:31.770 --> 00:18:33.530
The hundred men I killed

00:18:33.780 --> 00:18:36.490
were from before this happened to my body.

00:18:37.610 --> 00:18:40.910
And by the way, just because I don't die when I'm cut

00:18:40.990 --> 00:18:44.830
doesn't mean I'm fine with being cut!

00:18:45.200 --> 00:18:46.790
Especially the chest!

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:50.580
This pain... You want to try feeling it?

00:18:50.670 --> 00:18:53.090
No, I understand. Calm down.

00:18:56.630 --> 00:18:58.760
My sincerest apologies.

00:18:58.840 --> 00:19:02.350
Now that it's come to this, I will reveal the whole truth.

00:19:02.430 --> 00:19:07.480
Well, just as you intended to test my ability,

00:19:07.560 --> 00:19:11.810
I too intended to test your immortality.

00:19:12.270 --> 00:19:14.900
It truly was a sight that beggared belief.

00:19:14.980 --> 00:19:19.740
But what I've summoned you here for
is an even greater harvest than those 100 lives.

00:19:21.030 --> 00:19:22.570
I am the new head guard,

00:19:22.660 --> 00:19:24.330
Kagimura Habaki.

00:19:24.870 --> 00:19:26.080
I hope we'll get along.

00:19:26.160 --> 00:19:28.910
Why are you here giving me an introduction?

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:31.420
Can't you bring out some tea this time?

00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:34.630
All I can taste is iron, it's awful.

00:19:35.250 --> 00:19:38.210
So, what were you really planning to ask

00:19:38.300 --> 00:19:40.970
of someone with a body like mine?

00:19:42.180 --> 00:19:44.600
The job I wish to ask of you?

00:19:47.220 --> 00:19:48.600
Nothing in particular.

00:19:49.680 --> 00:19:50.850
The truth is,

00:19:50.940 --> 00:19:53.730
after confirming your immortality just now,

00:19:53.810 --> 00:19:57.360
your biggest role in this is finished already.

00:19:58.530 --> 00:20:00.320
Shall I open the screen?

00:20:00.400 --> 00:20:04.950
Yes.
I was just starting to find the smell of blood irksome.

00:20:10.330 --> 00:20:11.750
Now, my guest...

00:20:12.750 --> 00:20:16.250
why don't we let the real hospitality commence?

00:20:18.380 --> 00:20:22.630
What? Mr. Manji left?

00:20:22.720 --> 00:20:26.430
Yes. About half an hour ago, I'd say.

00:20:35.270 --> 00:20:39.190
A safe place for the night, that Mr. Manji knows of.

00:20:39.280 --> 00:20:40.570
MUTEN ICHI-RYU

00:20:41.650 --> 00:20:44.490
There's no other place I could go to, but...

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:27.530
I'm gonna kill them.

00:21:30.080 --> 00:21:32.250
I mean, killing is fine and all,

00:21:32.790 --> 00:21:34.830
but where am I right now?

00:21:37.540 --> 00:21:40.210
Don't tell me they're going to call in a chef too.

00:23:15.640 --> 00:23:19.770
Act Thirteen - Twilight

00:23:34.700 --> 00:23:37.120
Look! I just caught a glimpse of light.

00:23:37.200 --> 00:23:38.330
Where?

00:23:38.410 --> 00:23:40.870
It's your fear that's making you see that stuff.

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:43.460
When I go to the store,

00:23:43.540 --> 00:23:45.340
I sometimes pass by in front of here,

00:23:45.420 --> 00:23:47.130
and it always looks empty.

00:23:47.210 --> 00:23:48.800
I'm telling you, it's abandoned.

00:23:48.880 --> 00:23:52.550
If we clean every day starting tomorrow,
this could make for a cozy--
